config RUST_SELINUX_POLICYDB
	bool "Rust implementation of SELinux policy database"
	depends on RUST && SECURITY_SELINUX
	default n
	help
	  Build the Rust translation of the SELinux policy database unit.
	  This source reconstruction requires configured ABI, native build,
	  retained-C test and policy round-trip validation before use.
	  If unsure, say N.
